WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
This thing is a good thing

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:03,160
I'll use this in future battles.

3
00:00:03,160 --> 00:00:04,560
Then why are you afraid of the residents of the building?

4
00:00:05,040 --> 00:00:06,760
First go to the labor market to find the shop tax

5
00:00:06,760 --> 00:00:14,700
How about seeing if there is any work to do today?

6
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:16,900
Do you have any work to do today, Brother Xiao?

7
00:00:17,100 --> 00:00:20,500
I just took an order or what?

8
00:00:20,820 --> 00:00:22,420
Not far from the place you rented

9
00:00:22,420 --> 00:00:24,060
Helping him work for four hundred yuan a day

10
00:00:24,060 --> 00:00:25,580
But I have to work from morning to night

11
00:00:25,900 --> 00:00:27,660
I thought we'd come here tomorrow

12
00:00:27,660 --> 00:00:28,980
I don't know if I can find any work.

13
00:00:28,980 --> 00:00:30,060
So I got hard

14
00:00:30,060 --> 00:00:32,380
But I didn't agree to it for you. If you are interested,

15
00:00:32,380 --> 00:00:34,380
You can go with me wherever you go

16
00:00:34,620 --> 00:00:36,180
There is an important base next to you

17
00:00:36,180 --> 00:00:38,540
It's a greenhouse dedicated to growing vegetables and fruits.

18
00:00:38,540 --> 00:00:39,900
They need help building a greenhouse

19
00:00:40,180 --> 00:00:41,740
I heard that if it takes a long time

20
00:00:41,740 --> 00:00:42,860
It may take some time to do

21
00:00:43,340 --> 00:00:45,060
I thought it was more stable over there anyway.

22
00:00:45,260 --> 00:00:47,740
Although I don’t earn that much, my ability

23
00:00:47,740 --> 00:00:49,140
In fact, that’s all for one day.

24
00:00:49,340 --> 00:00:50,300
I agreed

25
00:00:50,580 --> 00:00:51,820
What is a greenhouse?

26
00:00:52,260 --> 00:00:54,300
The greenhouse is just the vegetables we eat

27
00:00:54,300 --> 00:00:55,740
Many of them come from greenhouses.
